        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CLB150060TEKSBR, 1-1/2\" Diameter 60\" Long Teak Wood Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunning door pull combines the beauty and the durability of Teak with the modern look of the solid brass brackets for a truly contemporary design. Home decorating has long used wood mixed with modern designs to add warmth to a room. The Teak Wood Door Pull is in its natural color and staining is not required. Teak is used for this door pull because of its hard, strong, durable characteristics. It is resistant to insects and warping, even when exposed directly to harsh weather, making it the ideal choice for exterior doors. This Beautiful Teak Wood Door Pull is a great pull for commercial doors or residential doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull can be made from other hardwoods. <a href=\"/products/columbia-wood-door-pull-first-impressions-clb150sbr\"><b> 1-1/2\" Diameter Wood Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CLB150TEKSBR Teak Wood Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
